			<_modifiedTimeWeak type="a">10.1.2026::7:57:16</_modifiedTimeWeak>
			<_description type="p"><IDescription type="e">
				<_text type="a">The system functional behavior represents all the top level functions of a system, the connections between functions and with the owner system inputs and outputs ports. This is a static data flow diagram. The user can create ports on the system boundaries and on the functions and can create associated functional flows. The ports can be nested.</_text>
			</IDescription>
			</_description>
