			<_modifiedTimeWeak type="a">10.1.2026::7:57:16</_modifiedTimeWeak>
			<_description type="p"><IDescription type="e">
				<_text type="a">A context diagram represents the operational flows exchanged between the system of interest and its environment in a particular lifecycle phase. The user can creates new ports and flows and also new operational system representing the system of interest environment.</_text>
			</IDescription>
			</_description>
